@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam defaultFontName Serif
actor Maintenance
boundary "Next.js UI" as UI
control "AnalysisController" as API
control "AnalyzeFeedback worker" as Worker
control "FastAPI pipeline" as NLP
entity "MySQL" as DB
Maintenance -> UI: pilih CSV dan Analisis
UI -> API: upload + CSRF + request key
API -> DB: simpan batch, ulasan, job (transaksi)
API --> UI: 202 + batch ID
Worker -> DB: lock batch, cocokkan attempt,\nset started_at
Worker -> NLP: POST /internal/v1/analyze
NLP --> Worker: results + candidate cases
alt layanan / output gagal
 Worker -> DB: attempt aktif menjadi Gagal
else output valid
 Worker -> DB: lock dan cocokkan attempt kembali
 alt attempt sudah berubah
  Worker -> Worker: abaikan hasil worker lama
 else attempt masih aktif
  Worker -> DB: simpan semua hasil, case Pending,\nrelasi sumber dan status Selesai (transaksi)
 end
end
loop sampai Selesai atau Gagal
 UI -> API: GET /batch/id/status
 API -> DB: status dan count
 API --> UI: snapshot ringan
end
UI -> API: GET /batch/id/cases dan /reviews (page)
API -> DB: query milik pengunggah
API --> UI: data halaman + meta
Maintenance -> UI: buka sumber case / halaman berikutnya
UI -> API: GET /reviews?case_id=...&page=...
API --> UI: ulasan asal berpaginasi
@enduml
